cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or reference DrvNest, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "DrvNest"
abstract: >-
  DrvNest is a free and open-source Windows driver scanner, installer and updater
  for Windows 10 and Windows 11. It enumerates every present PnP device through
  SetupAPI and CfgMgr32, reports which devices have no driver, installs missing and
  outdated drivers from the Windows Update catalog or from local INF folders,
  resumes its install queue after the restarts a driver install requires, and backs
  drivers up so they can be restored offline from a USB stick after a format. It
  ships as a single self-contained executable that needs neither the .NET runtime
  nor the Visual C++ Redistributable.
